        "text": "Here's the preview. Nothing has been deleted yet.\n\nIf you confirm, the following will happen to your Google data:\n\n1. **Remove the locally stored Google tokens.** The app will no longer have local credentials for Google.\n2. **Cancel any active Google jobs.**\n3. **Permanently delete the local Google records and retained raw responses.** This is the only step that removes data, and it can't be undone.\n\nThese options stay as they are:\n- **Google Takeout data is kept.** Takeout imports are not touched.\n- **Remote access is not revoked.** The app's authorization at Google stays in place, so you can reconnect later without a new consent screen (as far as I know).\n\nThe confirmation expires in about 5 minutes. Reply \"confirm\" if you want me to go ahead. Otherwise I'll leave everything as it is."
